[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Shared helpers (flightmd_core/analysers/helpers.py)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-012
STATUS: Active
TITLE: find_col and find_runs
STATEMENT: >>>
`find_col(df, candidates)` returns the first candidate that is a column of `df`, else `None`. `find_runs(mask)`
returns the `(start, end)` index pairs of each run of true values, end exclusive, and `[]` for an empty mask.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Inspection
