[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-021
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Windows from a state series
STATEMENT: >>>
`_windows(ts, on)` returns one `(start, end)` window per run of true values of `on`: the start is the timestamp
of the first true row, or `-inf` when that is row 0; the end is the timestamp of the first false row after it,
or `+inf` when the run reaches the last row.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
