[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-025
STATUS: Active
TITLE: vehicle_from_params
STATEMENT: >>>
`vehicle_from_params(params)` returns `Vehicle("ardupilot", frame)` when any parameter name starts with one of
`ATC_`, `INS_`, `AHRS_`, `SYSID_`, `SERVO1_`, `ARMING_CHECK`, `BATT_MONITOR`, `RLL2SRV_`, `Q_ENABLE`,
`FRAME_CLASS`; else `Vehicle("px4", frame)` when any name starts with one of `MAV_TYPE`, `SYS_AUTOSTART`,
`EKF2_`, `MPC_`, `MC_`, `COM_`, `NAV_DLL_`; else `Vehicle("unknown", "unknown")`. `Vehicle` is a frozen record
of `autopilot` and `frame`.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
