[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-026
STATUS: Active
TITLE: PX4 frame type
STATEMENT: >>>
`_px4_frame(params)` returns the frame of `int(MAV_TYPE)` when it is one of: 1 fixed_wing; 2, 3, 4, 13, 14, 15,
29 multirotor; 10, 11 rover; 19 to 23 vtol. Otherwise it uses `int(SYS_AUTOSTART)` (0 when absent): 13000 to
13999 vtol, 2000 to 3999 fixed_wing, 4000 to 16999 multirotor, 50000 to 60999 rover, tested in that order.
Otherwise: vtol when `VT_TYPE` is present, multirotor when `MC_ROLLRATE_P` is present and `FW_RR_P` is not,
fixed_wing when `FW_RR_P` is present and `MC_ROLLRATE_P` is not, else `"unknown"`.
<<<
