[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-027
STATUS: Active
TITLE: ArduPilot frame type
STATEMENT: >>>
`_ardupilot_frame(params)` returns, first match wins: rover when `ATC_STR_RAT_P` or `CRUISE_THROTTLE` is
present; vtol when `Q_ENABLE` is 1 or more; multirotor when `FRAME_CLASS` or `ATC_RAT_RLL_P` is present;
fixed_wing when any of `RLL_RATE_P`, `RLL2SRV_P`, `PTCH2SRV_P`, `TECS_CLMB_MAX` is present; else `"unknown"`.
