[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-028
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Rate gain names
STATEMENT: >>>
`rate_gain_names(vehicle, axis)` returns the `(P name, D name)` pair from `RATE_GAINS` for the vehicle's
`(autopilot, frame)` and the axis `roll`, `pitch` or `yaw`, and `(None, None)` for any other vehicle or axis.
The table holds PX4 multirotor (`MC_ROLLRATE_P`/`_D`, `MC_PITCHRATE_P`/`_D`, `MC_YAWRATE_P`/`_D`), PX4
fixed_wing (`FW_RR_P`, `FW_PR_P`, `FW_YR_P`, no D), ArduPilot multirotor (`ATC_RAT_RLL_P`/`_D`,
`ATC_RAT_PIT_P`/`_D`, `ATC_RAT_YAW_P`/`_D`) and ArduPilot fixed_wing (`RLL_RATE_P`/`_D`, `PTCH_RATE_P`/`_D`, no
yaw gain).
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
