STATEMENT: >>>
`GPSAnalyser` has `name` `"gps"`, `display_name` `"GPS Analysis"`, `required_topics`
`["vehicle_gps_position"]`, `optional_topics` `["vehicle_status", "vehicle_land_detected"]` and `weight` 15.0.
`analyse` returns `_skip("GPS topic has no timestamps.")` when the topic has no `timestamp` column and
`_skip("Fewer than 5 GPS samples <phase description>.")` when fewer than 5 rows remain after the selection of
LLR-ANL-030.
