STATEMENT: >>>
When `spoofing_state` exists, `GPSAnalyser._spoofing` takes its highest finite value over the kept samples with
no sustain test: `SPOOF_MULTIPLE` (3) or more gives a CRITICAL finding, confidence 0.9, penalty 30;
`SPOOF_INDICATED` (2) gives a WARNING, confidence 0.6, penalty 15; both of kind `gps.spoofing` with the window
from the first to the last sample at 2 or more. Values 0 and 1 give no finding.
