`GPSAnalyser.analyse` returns a skipped result (not assessed) when at least 5 samples are kept but fewer than
`sustain_n` of them (less than `SUSTAIN_S` = 2 s at the sample rate), with the reason "Less than 2 s of GPS
samples <where>.", or when `_any_usable` finds no usable value: no finite `fix_type`, no `satellites_used` from
