TITLE: f32
STATEMENT: >>>
`f32(v)` returns `float(v)` unchanged when it is a whole number, else the float whose decimal text is the
shortest representation of `numpy.float32(v)`, so that 0.05000000074505806 becomes 0.05.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
