[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-071
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Recommended ranges file
STATEMENT: >>>
`load_safe_ranges()` reads `data/param_safe_ranges.json` once per process and returns its top-level keys that
do not start with `_`: `px4` and `ardupilot`, each a map from parameter name to `min`, `max` (number or null),
optional `unit`, and `why`. The shipped file holds 21 PX4 entries and no ArduPilot entry.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test, Inspection
VERIFICATION_NOTE: Tests use the PX4 entries and their `why` text. The entry count is checked by review of the file.
