TITLE: ArduPilot vehicle
STATEMENT: >>>
`ap_vehicle(metadata, frame)` returns `metadata.vehicle_type` in lower case when it is `copter`, `plane` or
`rover`; else the mapping of the frame: multirotor to `copter`, fixed_wing and vtol to `plane`, rover to
`rover`; else `None`.
