For each combination that holds, `ParameterAnalyser.analyse` adds a finding with the entry's severity, kind and
title, a text made of the entry's reason followed by `<name>=<value>` for each parameter involved, the reason as
recommendation, confidence 0.95, `params` set to the involved names in order of first mention, and
`param_changes` from `_combo_fix`.
