STATEMENT: >>>
`PX4_SOURCES` maps the releases 1.13.3, 1.14.0 and 1.15.0 to one or two addresses each (the `fmu-v6x` default
board file or its `parameters.xml`). `AP_INDEX` and `AP_PDEF` address the ArduPilot versioned parameter pages
for `AP_VEHICLES` Copter, Plane and Rover, and `AP_SERIES` is 2. `fetch(url)` performs one HTTP GET with the
`User-Agent` `FlightMD gen_param_tables` and a 120 s timeout and returns the body bytes.
