STATEMENT: >>>
`px4_xml(url)` returns the fetched bytes, or for an address ending `.px4` the zlib-decompressed, base64-decoded
`parameter_xml` field of the fetched JSON. `parse_px4(xml)` returns, for each `parameter` element, its name
mapped to `default`, `min`, `max` (through `num`), `unit`, `type` (`BOOL` when the `boolean` attribute is
`true`) and `reboot_required`, leaving out fields that are `None` or `False`.
