[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-091
STATUS: Active
TITLE: ArduPilot metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
`parse_pdef(xml)` returns, for each `param` element, its name after the last `:` mapped to `min` and `max` when
the `Range` field holds exactly two numbers, `unit` from `Units`, `type` `bitmask` when a `Bitmask` field exists
else `enum` when it has `values`, `reboot_required` and `read_only` when those fields are `true`. When a name
occurs twice the entries are merged, the later fields winning, and the range is the lower `min` and higher
`max` of the two, or the earlier range when the later has none. No `default` is written.
<<<
