[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-ANL-094
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Generator main
STATEMENT: >>>
`main()` writes `px4_<major>.<minor>.json` for each PX4 release from the first of its addresses that fetches and
parses, with header `autopilot` `px4`, `vehicle` null, `version`, `source` (the address used) and `generated`
(today's date); and `ardupilot_<vehicle>_<major>.<minor>.json` for each tag of each vehicle, with header
`autopilot` `ardupilot`, `vehicle` in lower case, `version`, `source` and `generated`. A source that fails is
printed to standard error and skipped; `main` then prints the list of failures and returns 1, else 0. Tables
already on disk for a failed source are left unchanged.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Inspection
VERIFICATION_NOTE: No test runs `main`. Review checks the loop, the headers and the return value.
